@startuml F5.7-D01-criar-curso
title F5.7-D01 — Criar curso com secretários
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CourseController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar curso
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /academico/cursos
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT curso\n+ curso_secretario\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Sec: curso na tabela

@enduml
